# User-facing: avatar, not .vrm

**Locked 2026-08-22.** In UI labels, buttons, alerts, and status text, say **avatar** — not “.vrm” or “VRM” as the product noun.

| Do | Don’t (user-facing) |
|----|---------------------|
| Pick avatar | Pick .vrm file |
| Avatar Export / Import | VRM Export / Import |
| Load an avatar… | Load a VRM… |
| Download avatar | Download VRM |

**Keep technical:** `accept=".vrm"`, `endsWith('.vrm')`, filenames, APIs, and format version options **VRM 0.0 / VRM 1.0** (industry standard).
